<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hans">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>两只老虎 Guitar Chord Sheet</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #111827;
      --panel: #1f2937;
      --panel-2: #0f172a;
      --text: #f9fafb;
      --muted: #9ca3af;
      --accent: #fbbf24;
      --accent-2: #38bdf8;
      --line: #374151;
      --code-bg: #020617;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: "Inter", "Segoe UI", "Microsoft YaHei", Arial, sans-serif;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(56,189,248,0.18), transparent 32%),
        radial-gradient(circle at bottom right, rgba(251,191,36,0.15), transparent 28%),
        var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 28px 16px;
    }

    .page {
      max-width: 980px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(31,41,55,0.95), rgba(15,23,42,0.95));
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 28px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 46px);
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    }

    .subtitle {
      color: var(--muted);
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .info-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 22px;
    }

    .info-card {
      background: rgba(2,6,23,0.55);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
    }

    .info-card span {
      display: block;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .info-card strong {
      font-size: 18px;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .section {
      background: rgba(31,41,55,0.85);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 22px;
      padding: 22px;
      margin: 18px 0;
      box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.22);
    }

    .section h2 {
      margin: 0 0 14px;
      font-size: 22px;
    }

    .code-box {
      background: var(--code-bg);
      border: 1px solid #1e293b;
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 18px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      font-family: "JetBrains Mono", "Consolas", "Courier New", monospace;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    }

    .pattern {
      display: inline-block;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 26px;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      background: rgba(251,191,36,0.08);
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(251,191,36,0.22);
    }

    .beat-row {
      margin-top: 12px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-family: "JetBrains Mono", "Consolas", "Courier New", monospace;
      white-space: pre;
    }

    .song {
      display: grid;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .bar {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(15,23,42,0.96), rgba(2,6,23,0.96));
      border: 1px solid #263244;
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 18px;
      overflow-x: auto;
    }

    .bar-label {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: rgba(56,189,248,0.14);
      color: var(--accent-2);
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(56,189,248,0.35);
    }

    .tab-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(var(--cols), 42px);
      grid-template-rows: repeat(3, auto);
      gap: 4px 0;
      width: max-content;
      align-items: center;
      font-family: "JetBrains Mono", "Consolas", "Courier New", monospace;
    }

    .cell {
      min-height: 28px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      white-space: pre;
    }

    .strum-cell {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .beat-cell {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .lyric-cell {
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 21px;
      font-family: "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif;
      font-weight: 650;
    }

    .dash {
      color: #334155;
    }

    .note {
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .capo-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 14px;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .capo-table th,
    .capo-table td {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 12px;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .capo-table th {
      color: var(--accent);
      background: rgba(2,6,23,0.72);
    }

    .capo-table td {
      background: rgba(15,23,42,0.7);
    }

    .footer {
      color: var(--muted);
      text-align: center;
      margin: 28px 0 10px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .tab-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(var(--cols), 34px);
      }

      .lyric-cell {
        font-size: 18px;
      }

      .strum-cell {
        font-size: 19px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <main class="page">
    <section class="hero">
      <h1>两只老虎 / Are You Sleeping</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Guitar strumming practice sheet · C / G beginner version</p>

      <div class="info-grid">
        <div class="info-card"><span>Capo</span><strong>No Capo</strong></div>
        <div class="info-card"><span>Chords</span><strong>C · G</strong></div>
        <div class="info-card"><span>Time</span><strong>4/4</strong></div>
        <div class="info-card"><span>Tempo</span><strong>60 BPM</strong></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Strumming Pattern</h2>
      <div class="code-box">
        <div class="pattern">↓ ↓↑ ↑ ↓↑</div>
        <div class="beat-row">Count: 1  2&  &  4&</div>
      </div>
      <p class="note">
        重点：右手可以一直保持上下摆动。没有箭头的位置，手经过但不碰弦。
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Chord Sheet with Lyrics Aligned</h2>

      <div class="song">

        <div class="bar">
          <div class="bar-label">C</div>
          <div class="tab-grid" style="--cols: 8;">
            <div class="cell beat-cell">1</div>
            <div class="cell beat-cell"></div>
            <div class="cell beat-cell">2</div>
            <div class="cell beat-cell">&</div>
            <div class="cell beat-cell">&</div>
            <div class="cell beat-cell"></div>
            <div class="cell beat-cell">4</div>
            <div class="cell beat-cell">&</div>

            <div class="cell strum-cell">↓</div>
            <div class="cell dash">·</div>
            <div class="cell strum-cell">↓</div>
            <div class="cell strum-cell">↑</div>
            <div class="cell strum-cell">↑</div>
            <div class="cell dash">·</div>
            <div class="cell strum-cell">↓</div>
            <div class="cell strum-cell">↑</div>

            <div class="cell lyric-cell">两</div>
            <div class="cell lyric-cell">只</div>
            <div class="cell lyric-cell">老</div>
            <div class="cell lyric-cell">虎</div>
            <div class="cell lyric-cell">两</div>
            <div class="cell lyric-cell">只</div>
            <div class="cell lyric-cell">老</div>
            <div class="cell lyric-cell">虎</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bar">
          <div class="bar-label">G</div>
          <div class="tab-grid" style="--cols: 6;">
            <div class="cell beat-cell">1</div>
            <div class="cell beat-cell"></div>
            <div class="cell beat-cell">2</div>
            <div class="cell beat-cell">&</div>
            <div class="cell beat-cell">4</div>
            <div class="cell beat-cell">&</div>

            <div class="cell strum-cell">↓</div>
            <div class="cell dash">·</div>
            <div class="cell strum-cell">↓</div>
            <div class="cell strum-cell">↑</div>
            <div class="cell strum-cell">↓</div>
            <div class="cell strum-cell">↑</div>

            <div class="cell lyric-cell">跑</div>
            <div class="cell lyric-cell">得</div>
            <div class="cell lyric-cell">快</div>
            <div class="cell lyric-cell"></div>
            <div class="cell lyric-cell">跑</div>
            <div class="cell lyric-cell">得快</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bar">
          <div class="bar-label">C</div>
          <div class="tab-grid" style="--cols: 6;">
            <div class="cell beat-cell">1</div>
            <div class="cell beat-cell"></div>
            <div class="cell beat-cell">2</div>
            <div class="cell beat-cell">&</div>
            <div class="cell beat-cell">4</div>
            <div class="cell beat-cell">&</div>

            <div class="cell strum-cell">↓</div>
            <div class="cell dash">·</div>
            <div class="cell strum-cell">↓</div>
            <div class="cell strum-cell">↑</div>
            <div class="cell strum-cell">↓</div>
            <div class="cell strum-cell">↑</div>

            <div class="cell lyric-cell">一</div>
            <div class="cell lyric-cell">只</div>
            <div class="cell lyric-cell">没</div>
            <div class="cell lyric-cell">有</div>
            <div class="cell lyric-cell">耳</div>
            <div class="cell lyric-cell">朵</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bar">
          <div class="bar-label">G</div>
          <div class="tab-grid" style="--cols: 6;">
            <div class="cell beat-cell">1</div>
            <div class="cell beat-cell"></div>
            <div class="cell beat-cell">2</div>
            <div class="cell beat-cell">&</div>
            <div class="cell beat-cell">4</div>
            <div class="cell beat-cell">&</div>

            <div class="cell strum-cell">↓</div>
            <div class="cell dash">·</div>
            <div class="cell strum-cell">↓</div>
            <div class="cell strum-cell">↑</div>
            <div class="cell strum-cell">↓</div>
            <div class="cell strum-cell">↑</div>

            <div class="cell lyric-cell">一</div>
            <div class="cell lyric-cell">只</div>
            <div class="cell lyric-cell">没</div>
            <div class="cell lyric-cell">有</div>
            <div class="cell lyric-cell">尾</div>
            <div class="cell lyric-cell">巴</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bar">
          <div class="bar-label">C</div>
          <div class="tab-grid" style="--cols: 6;">
            <div class="cell beat-cell">1</div>
            <div class="cell beat-cell"></div>
            <div class="cell beat-cell">2</div>
            <div class="cell beat-cell">&</div>
            <div class="cell beat-cell">4</div>
            <div class="cell beat-cell">&</div>

            <div class="cell strum-cell">↓</div>
            <div class="cell dash">·</div>
            <div class="cell strum-cell">↓</div>
            <div class="cell strum-cell">↑</div>
            <div class="cell strum-cell">↓</div>
            <div class="cell strum-cell">↑</div>

            <div class="cell lyric-cell">真</div>
            <div class="cell lyric-cell">奇</div>
            <div class="cell lyric-cell">怪</div>
            <div class="cell lyric-cell"></div>
            <div class="cell lyric-cell">真</div>
            <div class="cell lyric-cell">奇怪</div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Capo Notes</h2>
      <p class="note">
        是的，夹 capo 会让音高变高。你还是按 C / G 的手型，但实际听起来会升调。
      </p>

      <table class="capo-table">
        <tr>
          <th>Capo</th>
          <th>你按的手型</th>
          <th>实际听起来</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>No Capo</td>
          <td>C / G</td>
          <td>C 调</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Capo 1</td>
          <td>C / G</td>
          <td>C# / Db 调</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Capo 2</td>
          <td>C / G</td>
          <td>D 调</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Capo 3</td>
          <td>C / G</td>
          <td>Eb 调</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Practice Tip</h2>
      <div class="code-box">
        <p class="note">
          先用 No Capo 练顺。<br>
          如果唱起来太低，可以试 Capo 2。<br>
          如果 Capo 2 太高，就试 Capo 1。
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <p class="footer">Made for guitar practice · Save this file as index.html</p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
